# Portfolio Website Files

## Repository Structure
This repository contains a fully functional portfolio website for videographers, designers, and music producers.

## What to Ignore

# Videos and media files (tracked through Git LFS)
*.avi
*.mov
*.mkv
*.webm
*.m4v

# Local backup exports
backups/

# Large image files
*.psd
*.ai
*.sketch
*.xd

# OS files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# IDE files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.sublime-project
.sublime-workspace

# Build files
dist/
build/
node_modules/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.log

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Documentation generated
docs/generated/

# Dependencies (if using npm)
package-lock.json
yarn.lock

## Note
Add your actual video files and thumbnails to this directory:
- sample-video-1.mp4 through sample-video-6.mp4
- thumbnail-1.jpg through thumbnail-6.jpg
